#: translation-drift.php
msgid "Translation Drift – Outdated Translation Tracker for Multilingual Sites"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: translation-drift.php
msgid "Flags translations that went out of date when their source post changed, shows what changed, and helps editors clear the backlog."
msgstr ""

